{"t":"Magic Forcefield","s":"magic-forcefield-a54b1","k":"item","i":"assets/wiki/Magic_Forcefield_459be2.gif","q":27,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><div class=\"twbox\">\n<aside class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-twbox pi-layout-default\" role=\"region\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"name\">Magic Forcefield</h2>\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\">\n<img alt=\"Magic Forcefield\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Magic_Forcefield_459be2.gif\" width=\"32\"/>\n</figure>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">General Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"objectclass\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Classification</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Navigation<br/><a href=\"#/wiki/Teleporters\">Teleporters</a></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Field Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"lightcolor\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Light</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"colorbox\" style=\"background-color: #00ccff; width: 1em; height: 1em; display: inline-block;\"></span><span style=\"margin: 0 0 0 0.4em;\">2 sqm</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"immobile\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Movable</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"walkable\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Blocking</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"mapcolor\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Map Color</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"colorbox\" style=\"background-color: #ffff00; width: 1em; height: 1em; display: inline-block;\"></span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">3.0<br/><span class=\"implementation-date\">October 28, 1997<br/>Alpha 3.0</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\">See also: Objects<span class=\"explained\">Help</span></nav>\n</aside>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-intro\">\n<div id=\"w-object-profile\">\n<div id=\"w-twbox-image\"><img alt=\"latest?cb=20150130104515&amp;path-prefix=en&amp;format=original\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Magic_Forcefield_459be2.gif\"/></div>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-look\"><div class=\"item-look tibiatext tibiagreen\">You see a magic forcefield.<div class=\"p-weight\"></div><div class=\"p-flavortext\">You can see the other side through it.</div><br/></div></div>\n<div class=\"\" id=\"w-twbox-sounds\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-object-location\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Location\">Location</span></h3>\n<p>Around <a href=\"#/wiki/Tibia\">Tibia</a>, usually near some Quests.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-object-notes\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Notes\">Notes</span></h3>\n<p>A Magic Forcefield is a game square that will <a href=\"#/wiki/Teleporters\">teleport</a> your character to a different location when you step on it. Portals cannot be moved, but some may only appear under special circumstances, such as flipping a switch, or placing an item in a specific location. Also, sometimes a portal is present, but it will only <a href=\"#/wiki/Teleporters\">teleport</a> you to a special place if you flip a switch or series of switches. Otherwise, it just <a href=\"#/wiki/Teleporters\">teleports</a> you to the next square.<br/>\n<a href=\"#/wiki/Azerus\">Azerus</a> and <a href=\"#/wiki/Versperoth\">Versperoth</a> turn into magic forcefields upon death.<br/>\nLooks the same as a <a href=\"#/wiki/Ship%20Core\">Ship Core</a> and can also appear <a href=\"#/wiki/Magic%20Forcefield%20%28Green%29\">green</a>.<br/>\n<span style=\"line-height: 20px; margin-top: 13px;\"><i> <b>See also:</b> <a href=\"#/wiki/Mystic%20Flame\">Mystic Flame</a> </i> </span>\n</p>\n</div>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div class=\"navigation\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Related_Pages\">Related Pages</span></h3>\n<div class=\"navigation-body navigation-list-wrapper\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"#/quest/alawars-vault-quest\">Alawar's Vault Quest</a></li><li><a href=\"#/quest/barbarian-arena-quest\">Barbarian Arena Quest</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Bruise%20Payne\">Bruise Payne</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Charged%20Disruption\">Charged Disruption</a></li><li>Constructions</li><li><a href=\"#/quest/dangerous-depths-quest\">Dangerous Depths Quest</a></li><li><a href=\"#/quest/dark-trails-quest\">Dark Trails Quest</a></li><li>Dream Machine</li><li><a href=\"#/quest/dreamers-challenge-quest\">Dreamer's Challenge Quest</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Gate%20of%20Deathstruction\">Gate of Deathstruction</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Gate%20of%20Expertise\">Gate of Expertise</a></li><li><a hr